ValueSet: SurveyedJurisdictions
Id: surveyed-jurisdictions
Title: "Surveyed jurisdictions"
Description: "The 31 European jurisdictions covered by the European Cancer Data Landscape survey: the 27 EU member states plus Iceland, Norway, Switzerland and the United Kingdom, as ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 codes. The four PHOENIX focus countries with dedicated deep dives are Germany, France, Italy and the Netherlands."
